      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The ethnic diversity in the Zandoria Basin presents a moderate to high, yet manageable, political risk for long-term infrastructure. The power dynamic, with the Kamba holding political sway while the Luvua control vital economic resources, suggests potential for elite competition rather than outright conflict. Careful stakeholder engagement and ensuring equitable resource distribution between the major groups will be crucial to maintaining project stability and mitigating future unrest.",
